e forward your well-being  is absolutely at the heart of this these  plans  um but we'll also be providing training  to  uh maternity services midwives gps  health visitors  who will who are already very expert but  these services that we're launching  today will  give highly specialized evidence-based  treatment  very effective we are out of time i'm  afraid but really good to talk to you  thank you  and it's so important to forget that  that stigma is going now and if you do  need help  do reach out and get it it's really  important  let's see if the weather is going to be  decent today are we seeing a little bit  of a peak in temperatures isabelle today  yeah they do go up a little bit the next  couple of days but they go  down again at the weekend but let's take  a look at today  [Music]  look forward to brighter skies the  weather  sponsored by qatar airways  today though in more detail we start off  with a widespread frost icy patches too  where we've got  wintry showers rain sleet and snow  showers continuing to pepper coastal  areas and there'll be one or two  developing inlands through the day as  well some snow or hail possible  it's definitely cold though temperatures  for most only around five  six celsius really quite pitiful but the  cloud melts away  and tonight there'll be a widespread  frost once again  perhaps as low as minus four to minus  six celsius  hopefully tomorrow though fewer showers  but it stays cold  for the time being  the weather sponsored by qatar airways
 

